---
// Attention on "北京 的 天气 怎么样": the query of 怎么样 matched against each Key (book weights), then the 4×4 lower-triangular heatmap (redraw of Fig 2-6).
// Only the 怎么样 row has weights in the book; the other rows are lightly shaded and labelled illustrative.
---

<svg
	class="dg"
	viewBox="0 0 720 560"
	role="img"
	aria-labelledby="d2-ai-title d2-ai-desc"
	style="min-width: 630px"
>
	<title id="d2-ai-title">Intuitive understanding of the attention mechanism</title>
	<desc id="d2-ai-desc">
		Upper part: while processing the sentence 北京 的 天气 怎么样 (How's the weather in Beijing?), the Query of 怎么样
		(how is it) is matched against the Key of each word. The attention weights are 北京 (Beijing) 0.35, 的 (the
		particle) 0.05, 天气 (weather) 0.55, and about 0.05 for 怎么样 itself; all weights sum to 1, so the output draws
		mainly on 天气. Lower part: a 4 by 4 attention heatmap with one row per Query and one column per Key. Darker cells
		mean higher weight. Only cells on or below the diagonal are filled, because each word can attend only to itself and
		the words before it. The 怎么样 row shows the same four weights; the other rows are lightly shaded and labelled as
		illustrative.
	</desc>
	<defs>
		<marker id="d2-ai-arrow" viewBox="0 0 10 10" refX="9" refY="5" markerWidth="8" markerHeight="8" orient="auto-start-reverse">
			<path d="M0,0 L10,5 L0,10 z" class="dg-arrowhead"></path>
		</marker>
	</defs>

	<text x="2" y="28" class="dg-title">Intuitive understanding of the attention mechanism</text>

	<!-- Upper part: one Query matched against every Key -->
	<g class="dg-node dg-model">
		<rect x="6" y="96" width="160" height="92" rx="8"></rect>
		<text x="22" y="122" class="dg-accent" font-weight="700">Query</text>
		<text x="22" y="148">怎么样</text>
		<text x="22" y="172" class="dg-sub">how is it</text>
	</g>

	<g class="dg-edge">
		<path d="M166,142 C184,142 184,78 208,78" marker-end="url(#d2-ai-arrow)"></path>
		<path d="M166,142 C184,142 184,122 208,122" marker-end="url(#d2-ai-arrow)"></path>
		<path d="M166,142 C184,142 184,166 208,166" marker-end="url(#d2-ai-arrow)"></path>
		<path d="M166,142 C184,142 184,210 208,210" marker-end="url(#d2-ai-arrow)"></path>
	</g>

	<g class="dg-node dg-context">
		<rect x="210" y="60" width="220" height="36" rx="6"></rect>
		<text x="224" y="84">Key: 北京 (Beijing)</text>
	</g>
	<g class="dg-node dg-context">
		<rect x="210" y="104" width="220" height="36" rx="6"></rect>
		<text x="224" y="128">Key: 的 (particle)</text>
	</g>
	<g class="dg-node dg-context">
		<rect x="210" y="148" width="220" height="36" rx="6"></rect>
		<text x="224" y="172">Key: 天气 (weather)</text>
	</g>
	<g class="dg-node dg-context">
		<rect x="210" y="192" width="220" height="36" rx="6"></rect>
		<text x="224" y="216">Key: 怎么样 (itself)</text>
	</g>

	<!-- Weight bars: length = weight × 240 -->
	<rect x="444" y="68" width="84" height="20" rx="3" fill="var(--dg-model-stroke)"></rect>
	<text x="536" y="84" font-weight="700">0.35</text>
	<rect x="444" y="112" width="12" height="20" rx="3" fill="var(--dg-model-stroke)"></rect>
	<text x="464" y="128" font-weight="700">0.05</text>
	<rect x="444" y="156" width="132" height="20" rx="3" fill="var(--dg-model-stroke)"></rect>
	<text x="584" y="172" font-weight="700">0.55</text>
	<rect x="444" y="200" width="12" height="20" rx="3" fill="var(--dg-model-stroke)"></rect>
	<text x="464" y="216" font-weight="700">≈0.05</text>

	<text x="210" y="258" class="dg-sub">Weights sum to 1: the output draws mainly on 天气.</text>

	<!-- Lower part: 4×4 heatmap, rows = Query, columns = Key -->
	<text x="2" y="300" font-weight="700">Attention heatmap</text>
	<text x="2" y="322" class="dg-sub">rows: Query · columns: Key · darker = higher weight</text>

	<text x="245" y="360" text-anchor="middle">北京</text>
	<text x="315" y="360" text-anchor="middle">的</text>
	<text x="385" y="360" text-anchor="middle">天气</text>
	<text x="455" y="360" text-anchor="middle">怎么样</text>

	<text x="198" y="398" text-anchor="end">北京</text>
	<text x="198" y="442" text-anchor="end">的</text>
	<text x="198" y="486" text-anchor="end">天气</text>
	<text x="198" y="530" text-anchor="end">怎么样</text>

	<!-- Grid outline: every cell, including the masked upper triangle -->
	<g fill="none" stroke="var(--dg-neutral-stroke)" stroke-width="1">
		<rect x="210" y="372" width="70" height="44"></rect>
		<rect x="280" y="372" width="70" height="44"></rect>
		<rect x="350" y="372" width="70" height="44"></rect>
		<rect x="420" y="372" width="70" height="44"></rect>
		<rect x="210" y="416" width="70" height="44"></rect>
		<rect x="280" y="416" width="70" height="44"></rect>
		<rect x="350" y="416" width="70" height="44"></rect>
		<rect x="420" y="416" width="70" height="44"></rect>
		<rect x="210" y="460" width="70" height="44"></rect>
		<rect x="280" y="460" width="70" height="44"></rect>
		<rect x="350" y="460" width="70" height="44"></rect>
		<rect x="420" y="460" width="70" height="44"></rect>
		<rect x="210" y="504" width="70" height="44"></rect>
		<rect x="280" y="504" width="70" height="44"></rect>
		<rect x="350" y="504" width="70" height="44"></rect>
		<rect x="420" y="504" width="70" height="44"></rect>
	</g>

	<!-- Illustrative rows: one uniform light tint, no values or ordering -->
	<g fill="var(--dg-model-stroke)">
		<rect x="211" y="373" width="68" height="42" fill-opacity="0.15"></rect>
		<rect x="211" y="417" width="68" height="42" fill-opacity="0.15"></rect>
		<rect x="281" y="417" width="68" height="42" fill-opacity="0.15"></rect>
		<rect x="211" y="461" width="68" height="42" fill-opacity="0.15"></rect>
		<rect x="281" y="461" width="68" height="42" fill-opacity="0.15"></rect>
		<rect x="351" y="461" width="68" height="42" fill-opacity="0.15"></rect>
	</g>

	<!-- The 怎么样 row: the book's weights -->
	<g fill="var(--dg-model-stroke)">
		<rect x="211" y="505" width="68" height="42" fill-opacity="0.32"></rect>
		<rect x="281" y="505" width="68" height="42" fill-opacity="0.1"></rect>
		<rect x="351" y="505" width="68" height="42" fill-opacity="0.46"></rect>
		<rect x="421" y="505" width="68" height="42" fill-opacity="0.1"></rect>
	</g>
	<rect x="210" y="504" width="280" height="44" fill="none" stroke="var(--dg-model-stroke)" stroke-width="3"></rect>
	<text x="245" y="532" text-anchor="middle" font-weight="700">0.35</text>
	<text x="315" y="532" text-anchor="middle" font-weight="700">0.05</text>
	<text x="385" y="532" text-anchor="middle" font-weight="700">0.55</text>
	<text x="455" y="532" text-anchor="middle" font-weight="700">≈0.05</text>

	<text x="506" y="398" class="dg-sub">blank: not yet generated</text>

	<text x="506" y="442" class="dg-sub">other rows illustrative</text>
	<text x="506" y="524" font-weight="700">怎么样 row:</text>
	<text x="506" y="544" class="dg-sub">book's weights</text>
</svg>
